WEBVTT

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.520
Look, the sky up above has begun to move.
Hora miageta sora ugokidashita yo

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.750
Your astonishment was so dazzling.
Odoroku kimi mabushikute

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.810
Should I forgive the lies you told me yesterday
Kinou tsuita uso mo yurusou kana

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.050
just because the morning light is so pretty?
Kesa no hikari kirei dakara

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:38.170
The sound of your laughter is always important to me
Kimi no warai goe itsu datte daiji da yo

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.820
because it gives me courage.
Yuuki kureru kara saa

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.680
It's not a lie.
Uso ja nai

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.460
It's a beauty really
It's a beauty really

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.610
Your voice whenever.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.990
It makes me have.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:51.660
Even the silliest things sound dear,
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.980
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo
Even the silliest things sound dear,

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.540
if it's your voice I hear.
kimi no koe nara

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.810
You're sad whenever.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.120
It takes you back.
You're sad whenever.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:05.460
It takes you back.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:08.840
My heart runneth over.
Hamidasu kokoro

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:16.040
Unable to control myself, I set off at a run.
Osaerarenakute hashiri dashita yo

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:19.050
I can forever.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:42.330
F-Finally, my parents bought me a video camera.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:49.630
Yes! At last, I can film movies or anything else I want to!

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:54.630
Ups and Downs of High School Life

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:06.960
It's not such a bad idea to film the local scenery.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.930
That's nice.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:34.910
Hold it, you!

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:36.810
Just what do you think you're filming?!

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.580
Ah, erm... That is...

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.360
Gimme that!

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.170
Wait!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.830
Just hand it over!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.040
Ouch.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.630
What about the camera?

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.850
And this would be...

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.210
What are you <i>doing?!</i>

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.530
You're the worst.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.610
Piece of crap!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.670
Don't let me see your face again, you sicko!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.650
My video camera!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.680
That woman will NOT
get away with this!

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.060
[School Entrance Ceremony]

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.970
You new entrants will be spending the next three years here.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.040
[Izumizaka Senior High School Entrance Ceremony]

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.210
As high school students, you will dedicate yourselves to your studies...

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:37.380
I'm glad we ended in the same class.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.780
Yeah, so am I.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.720
I'm really happy we're in the same class.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:47.590
I'd be uneasy if she wound up
somewhere far away, out of my sight.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:49.890
Hey, Manaka!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.610
Oh, Komiyama, Oukusa.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:58.860
Hey, you don't have to act so distant just because we're in different classes!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.660
You're so lucky to be in the same class as Aya-chan.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.580
No, Manaka can't relax for a moment.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.640
Toujou has become quite the hot topic among the boys.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.340
Word has been spreading that a gorgeous girl was accepted.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.650
Man, she's so cute.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.520
Toujou-san, look over here!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.950
Does she already have a boyfriend?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.630
It must be hard for Toujou.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.330
You guys are in my way,
and getting on my nerves!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.330
Sheesh. Men are all scumbags.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.830
Just because a girl's a little cute,
they flock to her like moths to a flame.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.410
All they think about is perverted stuff.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.450
It's you!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:49.590
Why is this sicko in here?!

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:50.590
Unbelievable!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.040
Hey, you really screwed me over back there!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.490
What's your deal?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:57.370
Why are you hanging around me all the time?!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.100
This is just a bad dream! A nightmare!

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.600
How is this a nightmare?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.430
You're the one who threw my video camera in the river.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.200
<i>I'm</i> the victim here!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.030
Don't you think my emotional damage was greater?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.980
That's my line!

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:13.650
Do you <i>know</i> how expensive repairs are?!
I demand compensation!

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:16.110
Say what?! You brought this upon yourself!

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.490
What was that?!

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.860
Shut up!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.380
You two back there. What are you
doing on the first day of school?!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.230
What're your names?

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.040
M-Manaka Junpei.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.950
Kitaouji Satsuki.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.300
As punishment, you two will stay after school and clean.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.980
Wax the hallways completely!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.380
No backtalk!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.340
That's so nice...

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:46.680
Your homeroom teacher
is Kurokawa-sensei, right?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.490
I so want to get punished by a teacher like her.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.680
And here I am,
already getting punished.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.630
What? A mopping punishment?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:00.500
Umm, the reason Manaka-kun has to wax the hallway...

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.900
is because Kurokawa-sensei is in charge of the clean-up committee.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.280
So, how about we go home together?

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.750
Aah, Manaka-kun!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:13.130
Damn it, why did something this sad have
to happen on the first day of school?

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.050
This is all <i>her</i> fault.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:16.710
Whose fault was it, again?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.290
When'd you get here?

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.070
What are you doing?!

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:28.490
Sheesh.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.540
Men are really weak against women like her.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.240
I can see right through that woman's tactics.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.050
For your information,
Toujou's not that kind of person!

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:41.250
Ehh, why would you know something like that?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.620
I've known Toujou since middle school.

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:48.160
Don't go talking about things you don't know.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.370
W-What was that?!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.430
Hey!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.140
Aww, not <i>this</i> again!

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.000
Ow...

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.460
Ow!

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.600
I twisted my ankle!

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.460
Hey, are you okay?

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:13.430
Leave me alone. This is all <i>your</i> fault!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.000
Hey...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.360
W-What's with you?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:23.110
Get on, I'll take you to the infirmary.

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:26.210
You just want to feel me up, don't you?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.590
Can you really get to the infirmary alone with your leg like that?

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.410
Mind your own business!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.260
Hey. That's why I told you.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.330
Here.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.420
Don't push yourself.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.780
Erm, you were...

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.750
Kita... Kita...

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:58.750
Kitaouji!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:02.000
That's right, Kitaouji.
That's kind of hard to say.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.930
Just "Satsuki" is fine.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:04.780
I see.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:08.130
Look, Satsuki, about the other day...

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:13.140
My parents bought me a video camera
as a "getting into high school" present.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.630
I was in a good mood, and
wanted to film as much as I could.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.970
And when I saw you standing there,

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:21.420
I thought it'd make good footage, and started filming.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.620
What should I do? Why am I having such a bad hair day?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.580
There's not even enough time left to put in my contacts.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:45.120
I have no choice.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.810
Has Toujou Aya shown up yet?

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:55.280
And to think, we've been waiting since dawn.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.020
Uh... Umm...

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:04.970
Huh?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:08.440
You ran into someone, and you're not even apologizing?

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:09.980
S-Sorry.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:14.460
Boy, this girl's about as boring as they come.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.090
This just isn't our day.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.320
Stop it, you two!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:23.490
People who'd bully a girl because of her appearance really piss me off!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:27.160
Just get out of here, you assholes!

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:30.400
What'd you say, you Amazon?!

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.960
What?!

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.720
Score! The infamous heel drop kick strikes again!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.710
Okay! And now the next one!

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:45.800
Ouch--

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.860
Crap! What are you doing? Let me go!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.520
Why would I let go?
What's this? A fight?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.340
Let...me...go!

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.340
Satsuki?
Let...me...go!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.410
Let...me...go!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:55.860
T-Toujou!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:56.930
W-Why?

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.350
Hey, knock it off!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.570
What?

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:03.240
Manaka?
Manaka-kun...

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.550
Ouch!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:18.370
W-Why does this
always happen to me?!

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:20.780
He can't be doing this... for my sake?

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.220
Manaka-kun!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.420
Are you okay, Manaka-kun?

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:27.560
Ah, Toujou.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:31.400
<i>You</i> were Toujou-san?!

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:33.700
Toujou,

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:36.050
you aren't hurt?

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.150
I'm fine. After all,

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.260
Kitaouji-san came to my rescue.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.740
Makes sense.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.750
Satsuki, are you okay?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.520
I'm fine.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.000
Why would this guy go and save me?

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:01.160
N-No. Why is my heart beating so fast?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:15.980
Hearts and Wishes in Disagreement

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.960
"A" equals "X" squared.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.750
In other words,

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.610
you can use "X squared
equals A" here, giving you...

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.110
W-What is it?

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.330
Let me borrow that.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.480
Wha-? I-It's okay.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.950
Just let me borrow it.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.690
I said it was okay!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.260
Just let me see it!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.570
Didn't I say to let me borrow it?!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:01.520
Wai--

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:04.900
This would be...

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.900
Where are you touching me,
you stupid sicko?!

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:12.320
Are you retarded?
You were the one that--

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.480
And what's your problem, anyway?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:18.450
I can't believe this pervert!

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:22.790
Getting this aggravated is bad for my skin...

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.790
Hey. Let me borrow it.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:29.560
T-Thank you.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.130
You've got pretty good handwriting.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:44.080
Don't I? My calligraphy is at Level 8.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.360
Oh. Level 8... wait, that's nothing to sneeze at.

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:53.150
Kitaouji-san seemed pretty worried.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.180
Is your finger okay?

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.360
It's not a big deal.
It's just a light sprain.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.790
Satsuki's just overreacting.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.600
But...

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:08.260
You and Kitaouji-san get along very well.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.350
It seems like you're having a lot of fun.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.550
Toujou?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:20.320
Staff Room

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.980
We don't have a film club?!
Staff Room

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.190
Oh, we <i>have</i> one.
It's just that no one's in it.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.880
Simply put, it's currently inactive.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.770
Currently inactive?

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:33.320
So if it had members,
it could be reactivated?

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.070
True enough,

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:38.460
but you need at least
five members to restart the club.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.680
Are you going to gather them?

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.410
I-I'll definitely try!

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:45.720
Or so I said.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.630
I need three people other than Toujou and me.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.890
Oukusa is in the soccer club...

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:00.980
Three... four...

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.560
One, Two...

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:03.990
One, Two...
Komiyama!

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:05.360
Three.... Four...

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.520
Three.... Four...
Komiyama!!

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:07.860
Manaka.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.920
H-Have you decided on a club yet?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:10.960
No.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.610
Thank goodness.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.390
You just <i>have</i> to join the film club!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.760
Huh? I don't feel like it.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:22.220
Don't say that! We need five people to revive the club.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:24.680
Say what you will, but...

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.790
This seems like an
interesting conversation.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.260
Erm... Who's this guy?

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:40.220
It's Sotomura! Sotomura!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.060
I'm in your class, attendance number 14.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.790
Oh, Sotomura, good morning.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.740
I'm Manaka, n-nice to meet you.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.530
More importantly,
did you say "film club"?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:51.570
Could I hear the details of your conversation?

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:52.650
One...

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.120
Just take a look at <i>this.</i>

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.410
Information
Free Trial
Newest Photos
The Beautiful Girls I've Found

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.380
I've been managing this "Beautiful Girls I've Found" website.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.340
However, I want to take it to the next level.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:07.960
Huh?

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:08.220
The Beautiful Girls I've Found

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:12.470
When I heard you talking about the film club, I thought, "Now's my chance!"

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.190
Wow.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:16.930
I can only photograph so many of the school's idols by myself.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.860
Won't you cooperate with me?

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:21.060
I'll join. I'll join the film club.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.150
I will follow you, Sotomura-sama.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.860
So, introduce me to lots
and lots of cute girls.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.620
Yeah!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.490
Wait wait wait!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.140
What do you mean, "cooperate"?

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:34.210
I'm making a film club,
not a porno club!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.370
Heh. You bring up a good point, Manaka-kun.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:37.980
Huh?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.200
Yes, the "film club" is just a ruse.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:43.870
But in reality, it's an "idol club"!

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.590
If that were the case,

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.340
the school wouldn't provide financial or computing resources.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.120
We'll tell the school that we're making a movie and planning

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:56.670
to screen it at the cultural festival.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.180
Make a movie ourselves...?

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:03.690
I'll leave the finer details to you. How about it?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.690
Don't you think this would be mutually beneficial?

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:08.110
Movies...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.800
That's right...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:13.810
I have to take any chance I can get
to reactivate the film club.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.800
My first step towards making movies with Toujou...

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.900
All right! Let's do it.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.410
One thing, though...

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.940
We're still short of the
membership requirement.

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.540
I'll join up.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.460
Satsuki?

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.910
You're making movies, right?

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:37.430
That sounds fun! I'd be happy to help.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.360
I'd be happy too!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:39.550
Then let's start with a picture!

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:40.570
Ah. Yes yes. Go with that pose!

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:41.660
Now, now.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.760
Still, thank you, Satsuki.

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:46.650
We were in trouble because we didn't have enough members.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.310
Let's make movies together.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.290
Sure.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.280
Toujou...

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.380
Things have taken on a strange form.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.200
But Toujou will be delighted, won't she?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.490
Now we can finally get the filming started.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.390
At last, our dream has begun to move.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:10.800
I'm sorry.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.050
I've joined the literature club.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:18.010
Why? When did you join them?

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.790
Why didn't you even tell me?

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:24.390
Of course, we didn't have
any firm plans, but...

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.400
Didn't you say you had
the same feelings as I did?

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.900
Didn't you take the tests for Izumizaka

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.600
in order to make movies with me?

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.020
Right, Toujou?

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:42.690
What's so wrong about me choosing my own clubs?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.180
T-Toujou...

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.160
So, you were way up here?

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.770
Satsuki!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.410
Hey, Manaka!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.710
When do we start film club activities?

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.550
T-Toujou?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.020
There's no way you'd...

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:13.200
There's no way you could understand my feelings, Manaka-kun.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.180
Manaka?

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.480
I'm an idiot.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.830
I really thought Toujou would be happy.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.370
But I was just fooling myself.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.570
Manaka?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:29.820
What's wrong?

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.380
Hey. What's the matter?

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.420
Are you crying?

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:43.070
I'm not crying! Leave me alone.

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.300
Leave you alone...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.060
I can't do that!

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:53.720
Give me a break. I just want to be by myself right now.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.790
Did something happen with Toujou-san?

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.020
It has nothing to do with you!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.860
Come on, if something
happened to you, you can tell me!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.780
I don't know what's got you so down,

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.610
but you might feel better if you talked about it, even a little.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:08.050
Shut up! What's with you?

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:10.370
I said I wanted to be alone.
Quit bugging me!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.420
Sorry if I'm bugging you,
but I can't help it!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.870
Because I like you!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.040
N-No...

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.750
So, I was...

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:33.060
S-Satsuki!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.770
Satsuki!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.480
No, stay away!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.570
Why are you running away?

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.330
Come on, the bell for class is ringing.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.590
Why don't <i>you</i> get back
to the classroom?

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:46.120
Just leave me alone.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.450
I can't!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.580
Why?!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.880
It doesn't matter!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:50.960
Yes it does, you moron!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.910
Damn it,

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:54.960
I'm here chasing you because
you said you liked me.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.620
Because I really like you, Manaka.

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:02.270
What are you, stupid? Just how many times are you going to say that?

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.550
And besides, what do you even see in--

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.150
I like you a lot!
And besides, what do you even see in--

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:04.750
I like you a lot!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.680
I have the most fun when I'm with you, Manaka.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.510
Isn't that reason enough?

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:11.520
I don't need to hear your reply.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.770
As long as you know my feelings, I'm fine with it.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.940
It doesn't matter who you like.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:21.610
I just want to enjoy my time with you every day!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.010
Satsuki...

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.490
So...

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:32.150
Let's keep having fun
from now on, Manaka.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.530
S-Sure.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.500
Let's have a race to see who can get back to class first!

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.710
Satsuki...

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:46.180
First you disrupt my class, and now you have the gall to show up late?!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:49.880
Unless you straighten up, you're getting sent to the staff office!

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:51.650
Sorry.
Sorry.

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.980
Now she's really got her eyes on us.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.390
Who cares?

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.960
It's comforting to have a partner in crime.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.360
Why does the number of people matter?

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.560
Seriously.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:08.920
She's definitely mad.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.730
I'm finished. My dream is over.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:12.640
You there!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:19.890
What's so wrong about that?

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:21.670
Because I like you!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.970
I've got no freakin' clue.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.980
